# {{ APP_NAME }} — Production Starter Kit

> **Project OS Architecture Boilerplate**  
> Dihasilkan secara otomatis dari Blueprint Spesifikasi Sistem & Dokumen PRD Resmi.  
> Stack: **Laravel 13**, **PHP 8.5 FPM**, **Nginx Alpine**, **PostgreSQL 16 (Strict ULID)**, **Redis 7**, dan **Coolify Cloud Support**.

